Third-party components

This project builds on the following open-source software. Each is distributed
under its own license (all permissive: MIT and/or Apache-2.0); their copyrights
remain with their respective authors.

Rust core (optigon-core):
  - candle-core / candle-nn — the ML training + inference engine     (MIT OR Apache-2.0)
  - serde, serde_json       — serialization / model metadata + JSONL (MIT OR Apache-2.0)

Native bindings:
  - napi-rs (napi, napi-derive, napi-build) — Node/Bun addon FFI     (MIT)
  - PyO3                    — Python extension FFI (abi3 wheel)       (Apache-2.0)

Tooling (dev/build):
  - Biome                   — lint + format tooling                  (MIT OR Apache-2.0)
  - Turbo                   — task orchestration + caching            (MIT)

Full license texts for these dependencies are reproduced in their respective
